{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We all know the story: hero emerges from humble beginnings, slays the tyrannical dragon, and ushers in a new era of peace and prosperity.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But here, it's the other way around.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ravager</strong> is a game where you play a young dragon, determined to reclaim his birthright. To do so, you will need to build your power, ally with dark forces, evade justice, and whet your monstrous appetites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/extras/b354d940c598324f77c96104a858a94a.avif?t=1768305069\" width=1280 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the Villain's Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your way through a dark fantasy saga that will lead you into the deepest reaches of the world, where you may build your lair. Combine forces with the half-human tribes, opportunistic mercenaries, and stranger powers - like long-forgotten gods, or conniving infernals. Return on the warpath, conquer the lands, and depose the regent who rules in your stead. Forge your kingdom into the shape you want, and reap the benefits of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/extras/9dfdb533abbaaaaeafe01d26ca27e00b.avif?t=1768305069\" width=1280 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Your Own Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to tackle your challenges through strength or cunning, respect or fear. There are no simplistic morality systems at work here, and you will not be punished for thinking outside of the box. Be magnanimous or tyrannical, honourable or devious, gracious or predatory - and feel free to combine those approaches as your heart and mind see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/extras/32de67a9c99547cf9fbfaa1cf56ee74d.avif?t=1768305069\" width=1280 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Harem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ravager</strong> has a voice-acted cast of dozens, each with their own motivations and inclinations. You'll meet eager supporters, allies of convenience, and deadly foes. Follow their ascent (or descent) under your influence, and decide their fate. Perhaps you might even find love along the way - or father the next generation of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/extras/a7e56fdffae1a35c416a9d9cdff825cb.avif?t=1768305069\" width=1280 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover The Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After almost five years in development, <strong>Ravager</strong> already features:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1,250,000 words of dialogue and narration. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upwards of 1,250 hand-drawn adult illustrations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than twelve hours of original voice acting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dozen fully animated scenes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will only increase as we draw closer to completion. <strong>Ravager</strong>'s adaptive narrative ensures that you can play it again, and again, and find new delights every time.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Fine Suggestion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683560/765df06997f6611268b930ca6b82ad6632f26b1f.jpg"},{"name":"Green Eyed Monster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683560/df8b0a8b006c43b7199e4d4e7fd7bfb067f79cac.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Dragon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683560/9551db0daf09d1b26c6653a467594500e2b7dd14.jpg"},{"name":"Scrooge McF***","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683560/a21b10066199ec4f2f188740eb158893a4d9b459.jpg"},{"name":"Badass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683560/46024d51b6925c6b308c23d0945959d26e6b89fb.jpg"},{"name":"Towering Inferno","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683560/07dd9a14ea15f54b1165bc508e6ea43eec822fd6.jpg"},{"name":"Chaos Reigns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683560/38f05d7660b36bee02056cde35234d5dd064623b.jpg"},{"name":"An Earth-Shattering Kaboom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683560/22885d61a6983d4a2808736b3ee93cf56f71e90c.jpg"},{"name":"Resignation Letter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683560/643198b83b1f8236eb2c545516cbfd7ff83516cb.jpg"},{"name":"A Slight Miscalculation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1683560/089a20cb70951a89cbfb07e353569cd86c61a43d.jpg"}],"total":82},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1683560?t=1768305069","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768305069","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/1f2224bedfc4a92c49e344fb5702bde94c259ec6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768305069","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/1f2224bedfc4a92c49e344fb5702bde94c259ec6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768305069","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"Ravager contains a large variety of adult content. You will be asked what you want to feature in your game, and it will be adapted to suit your preferences.\r\n\r\nIf you choose to include it, Ravager can contain depictions of: cruelty, violence, gore, torture, nudity, sex, sexual violence, sex with monsters and creatures, incest, drug use, and self-harm."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1745180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We all know the story: hero emerges from humble beginnings, slays the tyrannical dragon, and ushers in a new era of peace and prosperity.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But here, it's the other way around.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ravager</strong> is a game where you play a young dragon, determined to reclaim his birthright. To do so, you will need to build your power, ally with dark forces, evade justice, and whet your monstrous appetites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/extras/b354d940c598324f77c96104a858a94a.avif?t=1768305069\" width=1280 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the Villain's Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your way through a dark fantasy saga that will lead you into the deepest reaches of the world, where you may build your lair. Combine forces with the half-human tribes, opportunistic mercenaries, and stranger powers - like long-forgotten gods, or conniving infernals. Return on the warpath, conquer the lands, and depose the regent who rules in your stead. Forge your kingdom into the shape you want, and reap the benefits of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/extras/9dfdb533abbaaaaeafe01d26ca27e00b.avif?t=1768305069\" width=1280 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Your Own Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to tackle your challenges through strength or cunning, respect or fear. There are no simplistic morality systems at work here, and you will not be punished for thinking outside of the box. Be magnanimous or tyrannical, honourable or devious, gracious or predatory - and feel free to combine those approaches as your heart and mind see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/extras/32de67a9c99547cf9fbfaa1cf56ee74d.avif?t=1768305069\" width=1280 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Harem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ravager</strong> has a voice-acted cast of dozens, each with their own motivations and inclinations. You'll meet eager supporters, allies of convenience, and deadly foes. Follow their ascent (or descent) under your influence, and decide their fate. Perhaps you might even find love along the way - or father the next generation of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/extras/a7e56fdffae1a35c416a9d9cdff825cb.avif?t=1768305069\" width=1280 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover The Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After almost five years in development, <strong>Ravager</strong> already features:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1,250,000 words of dialogue and narration. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upwards of 1,250 hand-drawn adult illustrations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than twelve hours of original voice acting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dozen fully animated scenes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will only increase as we draw closer to completion. <strong>Ravager</strong>'s adaptive narrative ensures that you can play it again, and again, and find new delights every time.</p>","developers":["4MinuteWarning"],"dlc":[2558190],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1683560/148f8494239851af261ff56ccbc8a265091efad2/header.jpg?t=1768305069","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04, Kernel 3.x, or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min